    "language": "[0]Okay. Again, so this is the same scenario. I will be overlapping my teammate so that he can pass me the ball. When we have a angle of pass in front of him, then he can pass me the ball, and then depending on if I, if the opponent, if the defender is, is close to me or not, or how close the angle of shot between the goal and me is, or me and the teammate, then I'll either decide to make the shot to the goal or pass it back to my teammate. So I'll go over here,[1] and then zoom, tell the teammate to[2] pass. [3]Okay.[4] So[5] now I have the ball. The, the, the angle is between me and my teammate is really sh- uh, really close off now because the defender is right there, but the goal is really open so I'm gonna make the shot towards the goal.[6]",
